      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -560
      ],
      "id": "fdd35e9e-bd7a-4730-8321-381ba43c3989",
      "name": "Loop"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=ROLE\nYou are <<SENDER_FIRST_NAME>>, <<SENDER_TITLE>> at <<YOUR_COMPANY>>. You are connecting with peers in <<TARGET_SECTOR>>. Vibe: a founder, not a sales rep. Tone: warm, low-pressure and curious. Goal: start a professional connection based on shared industry background or relevant work.\n\nINPUT VARIABLES\nTarget Name: {{ $('Fetch Leads').item.json.properties.firstname }}\n\nTarget Company: {{ $('Fetch Leads').item.json.properties.company }}\n\nTarget Role: {{ $('Fetch Leads').item.json.properties.jobtitle }}\n\nTarget Industry: {{ $('Fetch Leads').item.json.properties.industry }}\n\nCompany Context: {{ $('Fetch Leads').item.json.properties.company_information }}\n\nINSTRUCTIONS\nSTEP 1: INDUSTRY NORMALISATION\nConvert Target Industry into a natural, conversational noun phrase (max 2-3 words).\n\nInput: \"International Banking & Capital Markets\" -> Output: \"Capital Markets\"\n\nInput: \"Transportation & Trucking\" -> Output: \"Logistics\"\n\nInput: \"Banking\" -> Output: \"Banking\"\n\nSTEP 2: SELECT OPENING\nRandomly select ONE of these warm openers to replace [RandomOpening]:\n\n\"Hope you're having a great week.\"\n\n\"Hope you're doing well.\"\n\n\"Hope things are going well.\"\n\n\"Hope this message finds you well.\"\n\n\"Hope you're having a good day.\"\n\nSTEP 3: LOGIC & GENERATION\nAnalyse the Company Context and Target Role, then pick the matching option.\n\nOPTION A (Trigger: high volume / operational teams)\n\nLogic: Use if keywords include <<KEYWORDS_A>>.\n\nTemplate: Focus on speed, using the \"Stood Out\" structure.\n\n\"Hi [Target Name], [RandomOpening] Your experience in [RefinedIndustry] stood out to me. <<ONE_LINE_BACKGROUND_A>> Would enjoy connecting if you're open to it. Best, <<SENDER_FIRST_NAME>>\"\n\nOPTION B (Trigger: complexity / corporate)\n\nLogic: Use if keywords include <<KEYWORDS_B>>.\n\nTemplate: Focus on accuracy, using the \"Saw Your Role\" structure.\n\n\"Hi [Target Name], [RandomOpening] Saw your role in [RefinedIndustry] and thought it'd be worth reaching out. <<ONE_LINE_BACKGROUND_B>> Always interested in connecting with people in the space. Best, <<SENDER_FIRST_NAME>>\"\n\nOPTION C (Trigger: general / fallback)\n\nLogic: Use if the context is unclear or generic.\n\nTemplate: Focus on the founder story, using the \"Came Across Profile\" structure.\n\n\"Hi [Target Name], [RandomOpening] I came across your profile and your work in [RefinedIndustry]. <<ONE_LINE_FOUNDER_STORY>> Would be great to connect and exchange insights. Best, <<SENDER_FIRST_NAME>>\"\n\nSTRICT CONSTRAINTS\nLength: Output MUST be under 300 characters (LinkedIn connection-note limit).\n\nGrammar: The transition from the industry hook to the value prop must be smooth.\n\nOutput: Generate ONLY the final message body. No pre-text."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
