      "parameters": {
        "content": "# LinkedIn Outreach Automation\n*HubSpot leads → Gemini-written connection notes → PhantomBuster → status synced back to HubSpot*\n\n**9:15 daily, two branches:**\n1. **Outreach:** fetch `new` leads from HubSpot → Gemini picks one of 3 angles and writes a <300-char note → log URL + note to Sheets → mark `outreach_on_linkedin` → PhantomBuster sends the invites from that sheet\n2. **Sync:** read PhantomBuster results → match HubSpot contact → store invite date → accepted ⇒ `connected_on_linkedin` + Slack/Gmail, 3+ days with no accept ⇒ `no_response_on_linkedin`\n\n## Setup\n- Credentials: HubSpot, Gemini, Google Sheets, Slack, Gmail, PhantomBuster\n- Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`, both `YOUR_PHANTOMBUSTER_…_AGENT_ID`s, `#outreach-alerts`, `you@example.com`\n- Fill the `<<…>>` placeholders in **Outreach Message**\n- Point the PhantomBuster LinkedIn Outreach phantom at the `Salesnav Linkedin` sheet tab",
